RELEASE HISTORY
---------------
1.5.0 03/07/2019
+ New feature to download only results which have changed since a particular date (using -d option)

1.4.4 15/03/2019
! Improved single test retrieval through use of function calls
! Fixed inconsistent micro antibiotic sensitivity results

1.4.3 24/10/2017
! Needed allow_change flag to fix old BNP title

1.4.2 24/10/2017
! Missing FER (ferritin) code added to dictionary

1.4.1 18/10/2017
! Incorrect BNP code (BNPP) in dictionary

1.4.0 15/09/2017
+ Support for retrieval of pathology tests recorded with a trial number

1.3.2 08/03/2017
! Resolved incompatibility with newer version of php-sybase extension

1.3.1 20/01/2017
! Warning about suppressed flag and not locked table means notification sent on most runs
! Remove logging from execute command

1.3.0 13/01/2017
* Upgraded to use newer version of core 
* Changed to use CLE_LOG_CONFIG env variable to point to log4php config file

1.2.3 07/12/2016
! Resolved issue with multi-status record creation and update

1.2.2 06/12/2016
! Patient ID search changed to include use of S number (i option)

1.2.1 02/11/2016
! Removed reattempt button for now


1.2.0 01/11/2016
+ Status record for pathology transfer, including timestamp and message in record
+ Integrated remote monitor module into transfer
+ Added path-lock management command to view lock status
* Use 'env_profile' setting to determine which profile to use when triggered
+ Improved use of resources and home tool class to deal with trigger
* Moved manage classes into command classes

1.1.4 10/03/2016
! Update pathology tests failing due to non-domain query and no empty patient handling

1.1.3 01/03/2016
! Tidied up pathology test list and added ige group

1.1.2 09/02/2016
* Updated pathology test list with cardiac tests

1.1.1 13/01/2016
! Missing server and date from pathology lock record
! Domain should not be automatically created

1.1.0 05/01/2016
+ Support for section/domain structure

1.0.7 22/09/2015
+ Additional tests to support acute module

1.0.6 15/09/2015
+ Additional tests to support brncts module

1.0.5 08/09/2015
+ HB test to dictionary

1.0.4 26/08/2015
! Stop pathology transfer trigger for users without pathology access

1.0.3 12/08/2015
+ Pathology transfer now triggered on any page not just home page

1.0.2 11/08/2015
* Improved locking approach using MSSQL DB table
+ Additional tests added for micro

1.0.1 30/06/2015
+ Auto removal of duplicate path encounters added due to lock failure
! Fixed .pathlock to prevent multiple instances running concurrently

1.0.0 01/05/2015
* Initial version of system
